From eb27a025e578881c23e9b601b99dd6a1870cc09e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: winry <fwrq41251@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 11:35:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(core): make danmaku websocket reconnect reliable

Use bounded one-shot retries for handshake failures, stream errors and remote closes. Ignore stale connection completions and drain abandoned channels without blocking retries.

Add loopback regression coverage for rejected handshakes, backup connections and connection lifecycle races.

Co-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>
Amp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a138ab-b613-729f-8432-2f85bfdeedc5
